Scenario: Edit Sales Order - Field and Grid Load Check
    Given we visit "orders/salesOrder"
    When we clear the from date and search
    And we edit the top row
    Then the following fields should not be empty:
    | field                               |
    | orders_model_date_purchased         |
    | orders_model_delivery_name          |
    | orders_model_delivery_suburb        |
    | orders_model_delivery_street_address|
